2012-01-16  Havard Eidnes <he@uninett.no>

	* ritz/net.tcl, ritz/ui.tcl, zino/server.tcl:
	Implement new style notify connection setup, where only the server
	listens for connections.  Implement some minimal protection using
	a random string to be repeated back to the server to tie together
	a normal server connection and the new notify connection.  Until
	that is done, no other traffic than the nonce is set on the notify
	connection, which uses port 8002.

	Ritz falls back to the old style notify connection setup if the
	new style setup fails for some reason.

	This should make it possible to use ritz from behind a NAT device.

