2007-08-30  Havard Eidnes <he@uninett.no>

	* zino/Makefile, zino/bgp.tcl, zino/status.tcl:
	Add checking of certain events related to external BGP:

	 o If a peer reset the connection, flag an event
	 o If a session has been turned off, flag an event
	 o If a peer is down, and the monitored system's uptime is > 10 min,
	   flag an event.

	Internal sessions will not cause any events -- monitoring of an
	iBGP full mesh (not the only way to deploy iBGP) should probably
	be done by another tool, and less frequently, e.g. once per day,
	to catch mis-configuration.

	* zino/trap.tcl:
	Add proper handling of SNMPv1 trap messages; tweak to eliminate
	the .0 apparently inserted in snmpTrapOID.

